One real irritation of using (apply'ing) bags is that you have to go through
either the entire list of what's in the bag if you wish to take something
out or the entire inventory list if you wish to put things into the bag.  A
'nice' bag feature would ask you what types of things you want to put into
the bag or what types of things to take out, just like the 'I' or 'D'
commands do.  It's easy to specify 'a' for all things if you really want to
go through everything.  

